MID_MV14_05: <SH>
MID_MV14_05_m001: Your usefulness seems to have ended.
MID_MV14_05_m002: No, that was...
MID_MV14_05_m003: Wasn't that Father's—
MID_MV14_05_m004: (quiet gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m005: (chuckle)
MID_MV14_05_m006: (grunt of effort)
MID_MV14_05_m007: (gasp of horror)
MID_MV14_05_m008: Father, you're...
MID_MV14_05_m009: (heartbroken exert)
MID_MV14_05_m010: (gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m011: (dodge exert x2)
MID_MV14_05_m012: Is your truest desire not to die...\nby your father's sword?
MID_MV14_05_m013: Goodbye, Leilidahna.
MID_MV14_05_m014: No... I can't...
MID_MV14_05_m015: (bracing gasp) (slow exhale of confusion)
MID_MV14_05_m016: (grunt of pain)
MID_MV14_05_m017: Are you hurt?
MID_MV14_05_m018: (shuddering, disbelieving gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m019: (grunt of pain)
MID_MV14_05_m020: (horrified gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m021: I am a traitor...and so...you wonder why...
MID_MV14_05_m022: I always loved you like you...were my own...
MID_MV14_05_m023: (slowly solidifying resolve)